{title: Dil Tadap Tadap}
{artist: Mukesh Lata Mangeshkar Salil Chowdhury}
{key: A}

{c: Verse 1}
[A]Dil tadap tadap ke keh raha hai aa bhi ja,        Tu humse [D]aankh na chura,
tujhe [E]kasam hai aa bhi [A]ja,        [A]Tu nahi to yeh bahar [D]kya bahar hai
[E]Gul nahi khile ke tera [A]intezar hai
Ke tera [D]intezar hai Ke tera [E]intezar [A]hai
[A]Tum se meri zindgi ka ye [D]singar hai
[E]Ji rahi hun mai ke muzko [A]tumse pyar hai,        Ke mujhko [D]tumse pyar hai
Ke muzko [E]tumse pyar [A]hai,        [A]Muskurate pyar ka [D]asar hai har kahi
[E]Hum kaha hai dil kidhar hai,        [A]kuch khabar nahi
Kidhar hai [D]kuch khabar nahin,        Kidhar hai [E]kuch khabar [A]nahin
